  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smart Adaptation of Forest Landscapes in Mountain Areas (SALMA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s objective is to enhance the resilience of vulnerable rural communities and their livelihoods in mountain areas through sustainable forest management. SALMA is believed to contribute to the achievement of reduced soil and water erosion, forest fire prevention and control, pest management, diversification of livelihood income (from ecosystem services) of 24 vulnerable communities, and improved adaptive capacity of these communities through reforestation (1 000 ha) and sustainable and participative forest management at the landscape level (1 000 ha).</narrative>
  </description>
